{
  "description": "Unattended recurring payment fee cap (native only; RN has no cap). Lightning: worstCaseFeeSat F(a) = max(minFeeSats, baseFeeSats + ceil(a * maxPpm / 1,000,000)), maxPpm = highest ppm in ppmExpiryTable (0 if empty), from ArkInfo.feeSchedule.lightningSend; schedule null = ArkInfo unavailable, use the published fallback (min 20, base 0, max 5000 ppm). capSat = min(2 * F(a), max(200, floor(a / 50))). Reason order: quote_exceeds_cap (quoteFeeSat > capSat), then schedule_exceeds_cap (F(a) > capSat), else within_cap; autoPay only for within_cap. Ark: autoPay only when quoteFeeSat == 0 (reason ark_fee otherwise), schedule ignored. Use overflow-safe arithmetic (saturate; a saturated value exceeds the cap). Values stay below 2^53. Shared by Android and iOS.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "fallback: 1 sat uses the 20-sat minimum",
      "input": {
        "amountSat": 1,
        "method": "lightning",
        "quoteFeeSat": 0,
        "schedule": null
      },
      "expected": {
        "worstCaseFeeSat": 20,
        "capSat": 40,
        "autoPay": true,
        "reason": "within_cap"
      }
    },
    {
